1.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=97 valign=top style='width:72.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=192 valign=top style='width:144.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=311 valign=top style='width:233.1pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=156 valign=top style='width:117.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=97 valign=top style='width:72.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=192 valign=top style='width:144.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:10.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:10.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\"Arial Bold\"'>Note : <\/span><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>1. Results\r\nmust be clinically correlated.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 2. Test\r\nconducted on Citrated plasma.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\"Arial Bold\"'>Comments:<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>Fibrinogen (Factor I), a\r\ncoagulation factor produced by the liver prolongs PT &amp; PTT at low plasma\r\nconcentrations usually<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&lt;100 mg\/dL. <\/span><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial Bold\"'>Afibrinogenemia <\/span><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>represents\r\ntotal absence of fibrinogen and is an autosomal recessive disorder causing\r\nmainly<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>bleeding from umbilical\r\nstump &amp; mucosa. <\/span><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Arial Bold\"'>Hypofibrinogenemia <\/span><\/b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>shows decreased levels\r\nof fibrinogen with a milder pattern of<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>bleeding. These are also\r\nassociated with recurrent miscarriage, antepartum and postpartum haemorrhage.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial Bold\"'>Dysfibrinogenemia <\/span><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>represents a\r\nqualitative defect in fibrinogen and is most commonly acquired due to liver\r\ndisease.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>Fibrinogen is also an\r\nacute phase reactant that rises sharply with conditions causing acute tissue\r\ninflammation or damage.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\"Arial Bold\"'>Decreased levels \u2013 <\/span><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>Disseminated\r\nIntravascular coagulation, liver disease, massive transfusion,\r\nDysfibrinogenemia &amp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\nfollowing thrombolytic therapy.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-U